# Extreme PWA App Implementation Plan

We will transform the existing React frontend into an "Extreme Progressive Web App (PWA)" with advanced capabilities. This goes far beyond the basic installation by adding features like offline support, background synchronization, custom caching strategies, and a rich, app-like installation experience.

